  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T F.749.3 specifies use cases and requirements for vehicular multimedia networks (VMN), including an overview, connectivity, intelligent human machine interfaces (HMI) for the vehicle multimedia system (VMS), privacy considerations, content rights protection in a converged network environment, copyright and rights management support for content delivery, security, safety, and definitions of vehicular multimedia configurations.</abstract>
